  {"ntp","shared","The server the device asks for the current time. Blank means 'use the gateway'.","ntp (empty -> eth_gw) passed to time_sync_set_server().","If time comes from the gateway and the gateway came from DHCP, whoever controls DHCP controls the clock - the NTP AiTM / Y2038 lab (Part 8).","netcfg ntp <ip> [port]"},
